{"symbol":"ACLD","yahoo":"ACLD.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Aelea Commodities Limited","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Packaged Foods","website":"https://www.aeleacommodities.com","about":"Aelea Commodities Limited trades in agri-commodities in India and internationally. It engages in the trading of sugar, wheat flour, rice, and maida products. The company also provides cashews, flavour cashews, cashew sweets, roasted, salted cashew nuts, cashew paste, and other cashew products under the Tryble, supreme cashew, and Kaju Katli brands. In addition, it offers onions, pulses, beans, rice, and other products. The company also exports its products. It sells its products to industrial consumers and retail outlets through brokers, agents, and direct sales. Aelea Commodities Limited was incorporated in 2018 and is based in Mumbai, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:05:45+00:00","quote":{"price":148.4,"prevClose":151.7,"marketCap":302.28,"high52":230.0,"low52":106.0,"pe":14.19,"bookValue":61.77,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":18.69,"shares":2.0369,"insiders":69.24,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2024-07-22","2024-07-23","2024-07-24","2024-07-25","2024-07-26","2024-07-29","2024-07-30","2024-07-31","2024-08-01","2024-08-02","2024-08-05","2024-08-06","2024-08-07","2024-08-08","2024-08-09","2024-08-12","2024-08-13","2024-08-14","2024-08-16","2024-08-19","2024-08-20","2024-08-21","2024-08-22","2024-08-23","2024-08-26","2024-08-27","2024-08-28","2024-08-29","2024-08-30","2024-09-02","2024-09-03","2024-09-04","2024-09-05","2024-09-06","2024-09-09","2024-09-10","2024-09-11","2024-09-12","2024-09-13","2024-09-16","2024-09-17","2024-09-18","2024-09-19","2024-09-20","2024-09-23","2024-09-24","2024-09-25","2024-09-26","2024-09-27","2024-09-30","2024-10-01","2024-10-03","2024-10-04","2024-10-07","2024-10-08","2024-10-09","2024-10-10","2024-10-11","2024-10-14","2024-10-15","2024-10-16","2024-10-17","2024-10-18","2024-10-21","2024-10-22","2024-10-23","2024-10-24","2024-10-25"